meta {
  name: Search Categories
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/client/categories/search?q=сан
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  q: сан
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Search Services (categories) by name

  Public endpoint backing the client app's search input. Returns a flat list of
  active categories whose name matches `q` (case-insensitive, substring),
  ordered by name, limited to 20 results.

  Each match carries its `parent` group (id + name) when it is a subcategory,
  or `null` for a root category. Icon fields mirror the categories list endpoint:
  render from `icon_url`, choosing the widget by `icon_type` — `preset` / `custom`
  are monochrome SVG (`SvgPicture.network`), `image` is a raster WebP
  (`Image.network`), `null` means no icon.

  **Query params:**
  - `q` (required) — search term, 2–255 characters.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 5,
        "name": "Замена труб",
        "parent_id": 1,
        "icon_type": "preset",
        "icon": "wrench",
        "icon_url": "http://192.168.31.158:8000/icons/services/wrench.svg",
        "parent": { "id": 1, "name": "Сантехника" }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "name": "Санузел под ключ",
        "parent_id": 1,
        "icon_type": "image",
        "icon": "category-images/9f1c2e.webp",
        "icon_url": "http://192.168.31.158:8000/storage/category-images/9f1c2e.webp",
        "parent": { "id": 1, "name": "Сантехника" }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  **Response 422** — when `q` is missing or shorter than 2 characters.
}
